        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Orgain earns its place on the shelf as an affordable, organic, good-tasting plant protein. The 21 g Organic Protein Plant-Based is the right tub for occasional smoothies, the Grass-Fed Whey is the better daily protein if you eat dairy, the 30 g vegan powder suits lifters who want plant protein, and Simple suits people who cannot stand stevia.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
